,"npc.thief.angry":`You're one of them! I'm calling the police!`,"npc.thiefGone":`The thief got away`,"npc.bagGot":`Got the bag`,"npc.returned":`Bag returned: +¥{n}`,"npc.kept":`You kept it: +¥{n}. The owner is calling the police…`,"npc.obj.scam":`Deal with the "accident"`,"npc.scam.fall1":`Ow ow ow! You ran me over!`,"npc.scam.fall2":`My leg! My leg is broken!`,"npc.scam.hit":`You actually hit me?!`,"npc.scam.demand":`Pay up! Nobody leaves till I get paid!`,"npc.scam.optPay":`Pay ¥{n} to settle`,"npc.scam.optLeave":`Ignore him and leave`,"npc.scam.optCam":`Show the dashcam`,"npc.scam.paid":`Right you are, safe travels!`,"npc.scam.paidShort":`That's all? Fine, just my luck.`,"npc.scam.cam1":`I've got a dashcam. Shall we play it back?`,"npc.scam.cam2":`…Oh! My leg just got better!`,"npc.scam.report":`Hit and run, eh? I'm calling the police!`,"npc.scamPaid":`Paid ¥{n} to make it go away`,"npc.scamFled":`The scammer ran for it`,"npc.obj.rage":`The other driver is coming for you`,"npc.rage.out1":`Who taught you to drive?!`,"npc.rage.out2":`Get out! Get out of the car!`,"npc.rage.out3":`New car! I only picked it up today!`,"npc.rage.ask":`So what are you going to do about it?`,"npc.rage.optPay":`Apologise, pay ¥{n}`,"npc.rage.optRude":`Mind your own business`,"npc.rage.paid":`That's more like it. Watch it next time!`,"npc.rage.film":`Fine! I've got it all on video!`,"npc.rage.punch":`Take that!`,"npc.rage.down":`Alright, alright, you win!`,"npc.rage.left":`Running away? I've got your plate!`,"npc.ragePaid":`Paid him ¥{n}`,"npc.obj.pregWave":`Someone is waving frantically at the kerb`,"npc.obj.pregRide":`To {place}  ·  {time}  ·  smooth {n}%`,"npc.preg.wave":`Driver! Stop! Please stop!`,"npc.preg.ask":`My wife's in labour! The nearest hospital, quick!`,"npc.preg.ride1":`Breathe in… breathe out…`,"npc.preg.ride2":`How much further?`,"npc.preg.ride3":`I'm scared…`,"npc.preg.ride4":`It's alright, nearly there!`,"npc.preg.bump1":`Ow - slow down! Slow down!`,"npc.preg.bump2":`Easy, please, easy!`,"npc.preg.air":`Why are we flying?!`,"npc.preg.done":`We're here! Thank you! We'll let you know when the baby comes!`,"npc.preg.late":`It's… it's coming!`,"npc.pregDone":`Made it to the hospital: +¥{n}`,"npc.pregLate":`Too late - the baby arrived in your back seat`,"npc.pregGone":`They flagged down another car`,"pax.name.normal":`Passenger`,"pax.name.rush":`Commuter (train to catch)`,"pax.name.queasy":`Carsick auntie`,"pax.name.chatty":`Chatty old-timer`,"pax.name.streamer":`Livestreamer`,"pax.name.drunk":`Drunk lad`,"pax.name.mystery":`Mystery passenger`,"pax.obj.smooth":`smooth {n}%`,"pax.obj.viewers":`{n} watching`,"pax.normal.board1":`{place}, please.`,"pax.normal.board2":`{place}, and step on it!`,"pax.normal.board3":`{place}. No rush, take it easy.`,"pax.normal.near":`Whoa!`,"pax.normal.drift":`Whoa, look at that slide!`,"pax.normal.air":`Holy—!`,"pax.normal.crash":`Easy, driver!`,"pax.normal.redlight":`That was red!`,"pax.normal.arrive":`Here already? Thanks!`,"pax.rush.board":`{place}! My train leaves in twenty minutes!`,"pax.rush.slow1":`Can we go any faster?`,"pax.rush.slow2":`I'm going to miss it…`,"pax.rush.near":`Yes! Keep going!`,"pax.rush.drift":`Nice! Don't stop!`,"pax.rush.air":`Fly if you have to!`,"pax.rush.crash":`Is the car OK? Then keep going!`,"pax.rush.redlight":`Good call!`,"pax.rush.arrive":`Made it! You are a legend!`,"pax.queasy.board":`{place}… I get carsick, please drive gently.`,"pax.queasy.near":`Oh my…`,"pax.queasy.drift":`Don't… don't swing it about…`,"pax.queasy.air":`Urgh…`,"pax.queasy.crash":`I think I'm going to be sick…`,"pax.queasy.redlight":`Slowly, please…`,"pax.queasy.calm":`This is nice, thank you.`,"pax.queasy.arrive":`Finally…`,"pax.queasy.tip":`Smooth ride {n}%  ·  tip ¥{tip}`,"pax.chatty.board":`{place}! So how long have you been driving, young man?`,"pax.chatty.lm1":`See that? {place}! I used to come here as a boy.`,"pax.chatty.lm2":`{place}… this area looked nothing like this back then.`,"pax.chatty.lm3":`That's {place}. Let me tell you about… never mind, watch the road.`,"pax.chatty.idle1":`Beijing traffic these days - more punctual than dinner.`,"pax.chatty.idle2":`I drove a yellow minivan cab back in the day. Ten kuai, go anywhere.`,"pax.chatty.idle3":`Eaten yet? I'll buy you a bowl of luzhu when we get there.`,"pax.chatty.near":`Ha! Driving like an old minivan cabbie!`,"pax.chatty.drift":`Easy there, youngster!`,"pax.chatty.air":`My poor back!`,"pax.chatty.crash":`Don't worry, the car's insured.`,"pax.chatty.redlight":`Through a red? Young people these days…`,"pax.chatty.arrive":`Right then! Lovely chat!`,"pax.streamer.board":`Hey fam, taking a cab to {place} today!`,"pax.streamer.near":`Did you see that, fam?! So close!`,"pax.streamer.drift":`Drift! Send the gifts!`,"pax.streamer.air":`We have lift-off, fam!`,"pax.streamer.crash":`Cut that bit, cut it!`,"pax.streamer.redlight":`Can't stream that…`,"pax.streamer.arrive":`Best driver ever! Give him a follow!`,"pax.streamer.tip":`{n} watching  ·  tip ¥{tip}`,"pax.drunk.board":`Take me to… {place}… I am not drunk…`,"pax.drunk.idle1":`You are my brother, man…`,"pax.drunk.idle2":`Let me sing you a song…`,"pax.drunk.near":`Woo! Do it again!`,"pax.drunk.drift":`Everything is spinning…`,"pax.drunk.air":`*hic*`,"pax.drunk.crash":`BANG! Hahaha!`,"pax.drunk.redlight":`Red light… what's a red light?`,"pax.drunk.warn":`Driver… I feel a bit…`,"pax.drunk.vomit":`Bleurgh—`,"pax.drunk.arrive":`Keep the change!`,"pax.drunk.cleaning":`He was sick in the cab: -¥{n} cleaning`,"pax.mystery.board":`Don't ask. Drive. {place}.`,"pax.mystery.wanted":`We've got company. Lose them.`,"pax.mystery.near":`…Steady.`,"pax.mystery.drift":`Nice hands.`,"pax.mystery.air":`…`,"pax.mystery.crash":`Don't wreck the car.`,"pax.mystery.redlight":`Good.`,"pax.mystery.lost":`We're clean. {place}.`,"pax.mystery.arrive":`You never saw me.`,"pax.mystery.triple":`Paid triple: ¥{n}`,"life.join.dance":`F  Join the dance`,"life.join.taichi":`F  Join in`